          {
            "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2017/11/09/exclusive-these-are-the-37-major-deals-us-firms-signed-with-chinese-entities-during-trumps-visit.html",
            "title": "These are the 37 major deals US firms signed with Chinese entities ...",
