              "# USTR Publishes Initiation of Section 301 Investigation into China's Practices Related to Technology Transfer, Intellectual Property and Innovation\nUSTR announced that the inter-agency Section 301 Committee, which oversees the investigation, will be holding a public hearing and seeking comments in connection with the investigation. Comments and requests to appear at the hearing must be submitted by no later than **Thursday, September 28, 2017**. The hearing will be held on **Tuesday, October 10, 2017** at the U.S. International Trade Commission in Washington, D.C",
